# DX Conventions

## Versions

- All workspace `package.json` versions must stay in sync — update every package when bumping
- The JSON-LD `softwareVersion` in `nuxt.config.ts` must match the current version

## Types

- API response types used by the web app live in `apps/web/types/index.ts` — keep them in sync with the API's Prisma models
- Prefer explicit return types on composable functions and API methods

## Dependencies

- Install deps in the correct workspace (`pnpm --filter <workspace> add`), not at root
- Root `package.json` is for shared tooling only (ESLint, etc.)

## Testing

- New API services should include a `.spec.ts` file
- Run `pnpm --filter api test` before pushing changes to API logic

## Linting

- ESLint flat config is at the repo root (`eslint.config.mjs`)
- Run `pnpm lint` to check — CI will enforce it on PRs
